# 📊 Sales Dashboard

An interactive and animated sales dashboard that provides real-time insights into business performance, revenue trends, and key metrics.

---

## 🚀 Features

* 📈 Real-time sales data updates
* 🎬 Animated charts and graphs
* 📊 KPI metrics (Revenue, Profit, Orders)
* 🔍 Filter and search functionality
* 📱 Responsive design (mobile-friendly)

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript / React
* Charts: Chart.js / Recharts
* Backend: Node.js / Firebase (optional)

