## ⚙️ Installation

1. Clone the repository:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/your-Mona3111/sales-dashboard.git
   ```

2. Navigate to the project folder:

   ```bash
   cd sales-dashboard
   ```

3. Install dependencies:

   ```bash
   npm install
   ```

4. Start the project:

   ```bash
   npm start
   ```

